{
  "answer": "Since your departure was delayed 6 hours due to a thunderstorm, which is considered an extraordinary circumstance, you are not entitled to compensation. However, Corvina will still provide care, including meal vouchers worth EUR 15 per passenger. If the delay required an overnight stay, hotel accommodation and transport between the airport and the hotel would also be provided. Please note that if the delay had reached 5 hours or more and you chose not to travel, you would have been eligible for a full refund. Claims must be submitted through the online form within 12 months of the flight date.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
